        "openmrs_entity_id": "",
        "type": "toaster_notes",
        "text": "<b>\"Rufaa isiyo ya dharura\"</b><br> Mteja hakuhudhuria kliniki mwezi uliopita<br><br><font color=\"#0061A4\"><i>Bonyeza </i><b>ⓘ</b><i> kusoma zaidi</i></font>",
        "toaster_type": "warning",
        "toaster_info_title": "Kwa Nini Kuhudhuria Kliniki ni Muhimu",
        "toaster_info_text": "Nakupa rufaa isiyo ya dharura kwasababu kuhudhuria kliniki kama ulivyopangiwa.\n\nKuhudhuria kliniki ni muhimu sana katika kudhibiti kisukari na shinikizo la damu. Husaidia kugundua matatizo mapema na kupunguza hatari ya madhara yatokanayo na shinikizo la juu la damu na kisukari kama kiharusi, magonjwa ya moyo, matatizo ya figo, na matatizo ya macho.\n\nKazi ya rufaa itaundwa fomu hii inapowasilishwa.",
        "relevance": {
          "rules-engine": {
            "ex-rules": {
              "rules-file": "ncd_followup_clinical_adherence_relevance.yml"
            }
          }
        }
      },
